      ],
      "title": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Conscious AI is a seductive myth that rests on the shaky assumption that computation is sufficient for consciousness, and taking it seriously could harm both machines and ourselves.",
      "sourceHeading": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI"
    },
    "n0002": {
