      "title": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Psychological biases like anthropomorphism and the lure of the techno-rapture predispose us to see consciousness in AI wherever intelligence and language appear.",
      "sourceHeading": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI"
    },
