      "range": [
        "spya-nh8mt7",
        "spya-cvaqgs"
      ],
      "title": "Intelligence Is Not Consciousness",
      "gist": "Intelligence is about doing while consciousness is about being, but three baked-in biases — anthropocentrism, human exceptionalism and anthropomorphism — make us conflate the two."
    },
