        "spya-d3g67c",
        "spya-cv97j7"
      ],
      "title": "The Computational Assumption",
      "gist": "Conscious AI presupposes computational functionalism — that the right computation is sufficient for consciousness — an assumption so ingrained it is barely recognized, and probably wrong."
    },
