        "spya-e7fdmb",
        "spya-d89xf7"
      ],
      "title": "What (Not) To Do?",
      "gist": "Nobody should deliberately create conscious AI, but conscious-seeming machines pose their own ethical dilemmas that we cannot test our way out of.",
      "sourceHeading": "What (Not) To Do?"
    },
    "n0131": {
      "id": "n0131",
      "depth": 2,
      "parent": "n0130",
