      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-e7fdmb",
        "spya-vs0vpj"
      ],
      "title": "Do Not Create",
      "gist": "Given deep uncertainty, deliberately creating conscious AI would be an ethical disaster, and the accidental emergence of consciousness in cerebral organoids deserves more worry than any LLM."
    },
